caturitthivimānaṃ.","Tassa kā uppatti?","Bhagavati sāvatthiyaṃ viharante āyasmā mahāmoggallāno heṭṭhā vuttanayena devacārikaṃ caranto tāvatiṃsabhavanaṃ gato.","So tattha paṭipāṭiyā ṭhitesu catūsu vimānesu catasso devadhītaro paccekaṃ accharāsahassaparivārā dibbasampattiṃ anubhavantiyo disvā tāhi pubbe katakammaṃ pucchanto –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[]]},{"para":2031,"vripara":"755","refs":[],"lines":["“Abhikkantena vaṇṇena … pe … vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":2032,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Imāhi gāthāhi paṭipāṭiyā pucchi.","Tāpi tassa pucchānantaraṃ paṭipāṭiyā byākariṃsu.","Taṃ dassetuṃ –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":2033,"vripara":"758","refs":[],"lines":["“Sā devatā attamanā … pe … yassa kammassidaṃ phalan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":2034,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ayaṃ gāthā vuttā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2035,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tā kira kassapassa bhagavato kāle esikānāmake raṭṭhe paṇṇakate nāma nagare kulagehe nibbattā vayappattā tasmiṃyeva nagare patikulaṃ gatā samaggavāsaṃ vasanti.","Tāsu ekā aññataraṃ piṇḍacārikaṃ bhikkhuṃ disvā pasannacittā indīvarakalāpaṃ adāsi, aparā aññassa nīluppalahatthakaṃ adāsi, aparā padumahatthakaṃ adāsi, aparā sumanamakuḷāni adāsi.","Tā aparena samayena kālaṃ katvā tāvatiṃsabhavane nibbattiṃsu, tāsaṃ accharāsahassaṃ parivāro ahosi.","Tā tattha yāvatāyukaṃ dibbasampattiṃ anubhavitvā tato cutā tasseva kammassa vipākāvasesena aparāparaṃ tattheva saṃsarantiyo imasmiṃ buddhuppāde tattheva uppannā vuttanayena āyasmatā mahāmoggallānena pucchitā.","Tāsu ekā attanā kataṃ pubbakammaṃ therassa kathentī –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":2037,"vripara":"759","refs":[],"lines":["“Indīvarānaṃ hatthakaṃ ahamadāsiṃ, bhikkhuno piṇḍāya carantassa;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2038,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Esikānaṃ uṇṇatasmiṃ, nagaravare paṇṇakate ramme."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":2040,"vripara":"760","refs":[],"lines":["“Tena metādiso vaṇṇo … pe … v